[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0010","text":"你好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0019","text":"老板"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0020","text":"欢迎光临\n哎呀，是上次的那位"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0030","text":"是的……打扰了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0039","text":"老板"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0040","text":"你能再来，我很高兴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0049","text":"老板"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0050","text":"两位是\n从很远的地方来的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0060","text":"是的，因为工作来到这个城市……\n下次再来的时候，我也会来光顾的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0069","text":"老板"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0070","text":"谢谢你\n不过啊……这家店，我打算要关掉了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0080","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0089","text":"老板"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0090","text":"毕竟年纪大了……\n这家店开了很久，我也很舍不得啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010800_02_0100","text":"………………"}]
